'''Skade''' ({{lang|no|ᛋᚴᚭᛞᛂ}}, ''Skáde''), officially the '''Kingdom of Skade''' ({{lang|no|ᚴᚬᛝᛂᚱᛁᚴᛂᛐ ᛋᚴᚭᛞᛂ}}, ''Kongeriket Skáde''), is a [[unitary state|unitary]] [[W:Sovereign state|sovereign state]] located in [[Southern Illypnia]]. It is bordered by [[Ostung]], [[West Lapland]] and [[Gotaland (country)|Gotaland]] to the north, the ??? Sea to the south, and [[Viborg]] to the west. Most of the country is covered by the [[Skjold mountain range|Skjold Mountains]], with the country's highest peak being [[Mount Valhalla]], at ?? meters. Skade is the ?? largest country in [[Adonia]] by [[List of countries by area|area]], and with a [[List of countries by population|population]] of ?? million, it is the ??th most populated country in Adonia and the ?? most populous in Illypnia.

Skade is an [[Elective monarchy|elective]] [[Parliamentary system|parliamentary]] [[Constitutional monarchy|constitutional monarchy]], comprising [[Cantons of Skade|18 cantons]]. The largest city is [[Storvik]], with a population exceeding 2 million inhabitants. Skadian citizens enjoy a high standard of living, and since 2001 Skade has been ranked ??th in the world for its [[Human Development Index]].

Since the mid-twentieth century, Skade has maintained a combination of [[Market economy|market economy]] and a [[Welfare state|welfare state]] with [[Universal health care|universal health care]] and a comprehensive [[Social security|social security system]]. Skade has extensive reserves of [[Petroleum|petroleum]] and [[Natural gas|natural gas]] in its [[Exclusive economic zone|exclusive economic zone]], along with [[minerals]], [[iron ore]], [[lumber]], [[seafood]], [[fresh water]], and [[Hydropower|hydropower]] in its mainland. The [[Petroleum industry in Skade|petroleum industry]] accounts for around one-tenth of the country's [[Gross domestic product|GDP]]. The country has the ?? highest [[List of countries by GDP (PPP) per capita|GDP per capita]] in the world, and the ?? largest [[List of countries by GDP (PPP)|economy by GDP (PPP)]]. Skade maintains an [[Foreign relations of Skade|active foreign policy]], serving as a [[protecting power]] due to its status of international [[Neutral country|neutrality]].

